<title>UK: Mexico to launch 750 mln mark 11-yr Eurobond -DMG.</title>
<headline>Mexico to launch 750 mln mark 11-yr Eurobond -DMG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico will launch a 750 million mark 11-year Eurobond shortly, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;It is confirmed,&quot; a syndicate official said. &quot;We are the sole lead for an 11-year transaction of around 750 million marks.&quot;  </p>
<p>Mexico last tapped the mark sector in February with a 1.5 billion mark 12-year bond. It was launched to yield 260 basis points over German government paper.</p>
<p>-- Hayley Pienaar, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
